Stage0 evolution plan: shift from search-first (60% web search) to think-first (80% reasoning). 5 phases, ~25h.

**Why:** User critique that Stage0 output is "too ordinary, relies too much on web search." Co-Scientist (DeepMind, Nature May 2025) demonstrated that 70% compute should go to VERIFICATION against structured knowledge, not generation or search.

**How to apply:** When implementing, target repo is master_investments (not _mmo). Plan lives at `plans/260527-hypothesis-driven-intelligence-engine/`. 5 phases:
1. First Principles Generator (Phase 2.6) — novel hypotheses BEFORE web search
2. Knowledge Graph — structured queryable evidence layer on top of flat vault
3. Refinement Loop (Phase 2.8) — strengthen/attack/evolve × N rounds until convergence
4. Mechanism-First Output — causal chains + falsification + evolution traces
5. Integration into SKILL.md

Key principle: contradictions are MORE valuable than confirmations. Every new component has null-check fallback — cannot break existing pipeline.

